      "section_type": "taxonomy",
      "original_text": "                                    Datura Stramonium L.\nSy     Datura                 V   Datura Pseudo stramonium          Sieb.     Stramonium vulgatum Gaertn\n                    Stramonium spinosum Lam.                                 foetidum Scop.",
      "normalized_text": null,
      "zh_tw_rendering": "學名 Datura Stramonium L.，異名包括 Datura Pseudo stramonium 及 Stramonium vulgatum。",
